    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>A river of flame surges over your arm, slicing through your upper arm like a cutting torch, not that you would know what a cutting torch is, living as you do in a regrettably low-tech fantasy world.</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> Pass a <strong>Challenging (+0) Endurance</strong> Test or gain @Condition[Unconscious], otherwise gaining @Condition[Prone] and @Condition[Stunned] (4). You lose the arm – @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.MnMZv7ZXoRqoH9dS]{Amputation (Difficult)}.</p>"
